          find the simplified forms for <m>A \cup B</m> and <m>A \cap B</m>. 
        </p>
        <p>
          <m>A \cup B</m> = <fillin name="union_blank" ansobj="unionSet" mode="set" parser="parseSet"/>
        </p>
        <p>
          <m>A \cap B</m> = <fillin name="intersect_blank" ansobj="intersectSet" mode="set" parser="parseSet"/>
